{"seq":2,"slug":"mcp-protocol","title":"MCP 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/tool-integration/mcp-protocol","wordCount":1124,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"mcp-协议\">MCP 协议</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Model Context Protocol（MCP）是 Anthropic 提出的开放协议标准：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>旨在解决 AI 应用与外部数据源和工具之间的互操作性问题</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"ai-界的-usb\">「AI 界的 USB」</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类比</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准化协议</td>\n<td>MCP 定义了一套标准化的通信协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统一连接</td>\n<td>任何 LLM 应用都能统一连接任意数据源和工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>USB 之于硬件</td>\n<td>类似 USB 协议统一了硬件连接标准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Claude Desktop]--&gt;D[JSON-RPC 2.0]&#10;    B[IDE 插件]--&gt;D&#10;    C[自定义应用]--&gt;D&#10;    D--&gt;E[文件系统]&#10;    D--&gt;F[数据库]&#10;    D--&gt;G[API 服务]&#10;    D--&gt;H[知识库]\">flowchart TD\n    A[Claude Desktop]--&gt;D[JSON-RPC 2.0]\n    B[IDE 插件]--&gt;D\n    C[自定义应用]--&gt;D\n    D--&gt;E[文件系统]\n    D--&gt;F[数据库]\n    D--&gt;G[API 服务]\n    D--&gt;H[知识库]</pre><h3 id=\"与既有方案对比\">与既有方案对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>MCP</th>\n<th>传统 Function Calling</th>\n<th>REST API</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准化程度</td>\n<td>开放协议</td>\n<td>各厂商自定义</td>\n<td>HTTP 标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发现机制</td>\n<td>动态能力发现</td>\n<td>静态定义</td>\n<td>OpenAPI/Swagger</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信方式</td>\n<td>JSON-RPC 2.0（stdio / Streamable HTTP）</td>\n<td>HTTP 请求</td>\n<td>HTTP 请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双向通信</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>需 WebSocket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文共享</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>需手动管理</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态系统</td>\n<td>快速增长</td>\n<td>各框架独立</td>\n<td>成熟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"服务器开发\">服务器开发</h2><p>MCP 服务器通过 JSON-RPC 2.0 协议与客户端通信，暴露三种核心原语。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三种原语的定位\">三种原语的定位</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原语</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>典型例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工具（Tools）</td>\n<td>执行操作（写入、搜索、计算）</td>\n<td><code>search_codebase</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源（Resources）</td>\n<td>提供只读数据（文档、配置）</td>\n<td>项目架构文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提示模板（Prompts）</td>\n<td>封装可复用的交互模式</td>\n<td>代码评审模板</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"注册工具\">注册工具</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"server.tool(&#10;  &#39;search_codebase&#39;,&#10;  &#39;在代码库中搜索文件和符号&#39;,&#10;  {&#10;    query: z.string(),&#10;    searchType: z.enum([&#39;regex&#39;, &#39;semantic&#39;]),&#10;    maxResults: z.number().default(10),&#10;  },&#10;  async (args) =&gt; ({&#10;    content: [{ type: &#39;text&#39;, text: await search(args) }],&#10;  }),&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">server.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'search_codebase'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '在代码库中搜索文件和符号'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    query: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    searchType: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'regex'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'semantic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxResults: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    content: [{ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, text: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> search</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(args) }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>工具返回值可带 <code>isError</code> 标记（如 <code>run_tests</code> 在用例失败时置真）</li>\n<li>服务器实例通过 <code>new McpServer({ name, version })</code> 创建</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"注册资源与提示模板\">注册资源与提示模板</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"server.resource(&#39;project://architecture&#39;, &#39;项目架构文档&#39;, &#39;text/markdown&#39;, async () =&gt; ({&#10;  content: [{ type: &#39;text&#39;, text: await readDoc() }],&#10;}));&#10;server.prompt(&#39;code_review&#39;, &#39;代码评审提示模板&#39;, { filePath: z.string() }, async ({ filePath }) =&gt;&#10;  reviewPromptFor(filePath),&#10;);&#10;await server.connect(new StdioServerTransport());\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">server.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'project://architecture'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'项目架构文档'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text/markdown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  content: [{ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, text: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> readDoc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">server.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prompt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'code_review'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'代码评审提示模板'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { filePath: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">filePath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  reviewPromptFor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(filePath),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> server.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StdioServerTransport</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"客户端集成\">客户端集成</h2><ul>\n<li>MCP 客户端负责发现和调用 MCP 服务器的能力</li>\n<li>客户端通过协议协商获取服务器的工具列表，然后将这些工具暴露给 LLM</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"连接与能力发现\">连接与能力发现</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>客户端 API</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>connect()</code></td>\n<td>建立与服务器的传输连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>listTools()</code></td>\n<td>发现服务器暴露的工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>listResources()</code></td>\n<td>发现可读资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>callTool()</code></td>\n<td>按名称调用工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>readResource()</code></td>\n<td>读取资源内容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"await client.connect(transport);&#10;const { tools } = await client.listTools();&#10;const result = await client.callTool(&#39;search_codebase&#39;, {&#10;  query: &#39;async function&#39;,&#10;  maxResults: 5,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(transport);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tools</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">listTools</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">callTool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'search_codebase'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  query: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'async function'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  maxResults: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"适配层设计\">适配层设计</h3><p>客户端的关键设计是<strong>适配层</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>将 MCP 的工具定义转换为特定 LLM 提供商的格式</li>\n<li>使 MCP 服务器可以被任何 LLM 应用使用</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const convertToOpenAITools = (mcpTools) =&gt;&#10;  mcpTools.map((tool) =&gt; ({&#10;    type: &#39;function&#39;,&#10;    function: {&#10;      name: tool.name,&#10;      description: tool.description ?? &#39;&#39;,&#10;      parameters: tool.inputSchema,&#10;    },&#10;  }));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> convertToOpenAITools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mcpTools</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mcpTools.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'function'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    function: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: tool.name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      description: tool.description </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      parameters: tool.inputSchema,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }));</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"传输层与通信\">传输层与通信</h2><ul>\n<li>MCP 规范定义了两种传输方式，适应不同的部署场景</li>\n<li>传输层的选择影响延迟、可靠性和部署复杂度</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"当前规范的两种传输方式\">当前规范的两种传输方式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传输方式</th>\n<th>通信模型</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>部署方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Stdio</td>\n<td>进程间管道</td>\n<td>本地工具</td>\n<td>子进程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Streamable HTTP</td>\n<td>HTTP POST/GET + 可选 SSE 流式响应</td>\n<td>远程服务</td>\n<td>Web 服务器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Streamable HTTP 由单个端点（如 <code>/mcp</code>）承载：客户端以 POST 发送 JSON-RPC 消息，服务器可返回普通 JSON 响应，也可以 <code>text/event-stream</code> 以 SSE 分块流式返回；可选的 <code>Mcp-Session-Id</code> 头维护会话状态，也允许无状态部署。</p>\n<h3 id=\"传输层版本沿革\">传输层版本沿革</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规范版本</th>\n<th>变化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2024-11-05</td>\n<td>初版传输：stdio + HTTP+SSE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025-03-26</td>\n<td>引入 Streamable HTTP 取代 HTTP+SSE，旧传输进入废弃兼容期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025-06-18</td>\n<td>移除 JSON-RPC 批处理支持，Streamable HTTP 成为唯一远程传输</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-03-26/basic/transports\">MCP 规范 2025-03-26 Transports</a>、<a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-06-18/changelog\">2025-06-18 Changelog</a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>注意：WebSocket 从未进入 MCP 官方规范；早期资料中「SSE + WebSocket」的说法对应的是废弃前的实验生态，现行远程集成一律走 Streamable HTTP。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"选型建议\">选型建议</h3><ul>\n<li>Stdio 传输最适合本地开发工具（如 IDE 插件连接本地分析服务）</li>\n<li>Streamable HTTP 适合云端部署的 MCP 服务器（如数据库代理、API 网关），无状态模式利于水平扩展</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const stdioTransport = new StdioServerTransport();&#10;const httpTransport = new StreamableHTTPServerTransport({ sessionIdGenerator: undefined });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stdioTransport</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StdioServerTransport</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> httpTransport</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StreamableHTTPServerTransport</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ sessionIdGenerator: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"安全性与生产部署\">安全性与生产部署</h2><p>MCP 的安全模型基于最小权限原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个 MCP 服务器只暴露必要的能力</li>\n<li>客户端通过配置选择信任哪些服务器</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"安全包装器\">安全包装器</h3><p>用高阶函数把速率限制与审计统一包进每个工具处理器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const withSecurity = (handler) =&gt; async (args) =&gt; {&#10;  if (++callCount &gt; config.rateLimitPerMinute) {&#10;    return {&#10;      content: [{ type: &#39;text&#39;, text: &#39;速率限制&#39; }],&#10;      isError: true,&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;  config.auditLog({ args, callCount });&#10;  return handler(args);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> withSecurity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">callCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.rateLimitPerMinute) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      content: [{ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, text: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'速率限制'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      isError: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  config.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">auditLog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ args, callCount });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(args);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"生产关注点\">生产关注点</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>速率限制</td>\n<td>按分钟计数并定时重置，防止过度调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>操作审计</td>\n<td>记录每次调用的时间戳与参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小权限</td>\n<td>只暴露 <code>allowedOperations</code> 中声明的能力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MCP 是 AI 应用与外部系统的标准化互操作协议，类似 USB 之于硬件</li>\n<li>服务器暴露三种原语：工具（操作）、资源（数据）、提示模板（交互模式）</li>\n<li>客户端通过适配层将 MCP 能力转换为特定 LLM 格式，实现一次开发到处可用</li>\n<li>Stdio 适合本地工具集成，Streamable HTTP 适合远程服务部署（2025-03 规范起取代 HTTP+SSE）</li>\n<li>生产部署需关注速率限制、操作审计和最小权限控制</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MCP 协议","id":"mcp-协议"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"「AI 界的 USB」","id":"ai-界的-usb"},{"level":3,"text":"与既有方案对比","id":"与既有方案对比"},{"level":2,"text":"服务器开发","id":"服务器开发"},{"level":3,"text":"三种原语的定位","id":"三种原语的定位"},{"level":3,"text":"注册工具","id":"注册工具"},{"level":3,"text":"注册资源与提示模板","id":"注册资源与提示模板"},{"level":2,"text":"客户端集成","id":"客户端集成"},{"level":3,"text":"连接与能力发现","id":"连接与能力发现"},{"level":3,"text":"适配层设计","id":"适配层设计"},{"level":2,"text":"传输层与通信","id":"传输层与通信"},{"level":3,"text":"当前规范的两种传输方式","id":"当前规范的两种传输方式"},{"level":3,"text":"传输层版本沿革","id":"传输层版本沿革"},{"level":3,"text":"选型建议","id":"选型建议"},{"level":2,"text":"安全性与生产部署","id":"安全性与生产部署"},{"level":3,"text":"安全包装器","id":"安全包装器"},{"level":3,"text":"生产关注点","id":"生产关注点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Function Calling 机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/tool-integration/function-calling"},"next":{"title":"工具编排与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/tool-integration/tool-orchestration"}}